WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Download in Sub & Dub.
One episode. Two versions. Here is how to save both.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Tap the download icon.
Open an anime. Check the episode shown beside Play.

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:18.500
Choose Sub. Pick a source.
Select Sub sources or the Sub tab. This example uses Vidstream-2.

4
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Pick a quality. Tap Download.
Lower quality uses less storage. We are saving 360p here.

5
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.500
Sub added.
You can follow its progress in Library → Downloads.

6
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:37.500
Open Download again.
Repeat the process for the same episode in Dub.

7
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:46.500
Switch to Dub.
Tap Dub in the source picker. The available sources update.

8
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:53.000
Pick a Dub source.
Check the Dub label before you continue.

9
00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:00.500
Choose quality. Download Dub.
Select the quality you want, then tap Download.

10
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:07.500
Go back. Open Library.
Use the Library tab in the bottom navigation.

11
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:15.500
Tap Downloads.
Sub and Dub appear separately. Wait for Ready offline.

12
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:23.500
Both versions. Ready offline.
Tap Watch offline on the version you want.

